# Project-owned ignore rules. Build output and editor junk only — see the note
# in ../rootapp/.gitignore for why there are no credential patterns here.
#
# Package.resolved is deliberately NOT ignored. Two repositories in this fleet
# excluded it (one via a bare `*.resolved`), which made their Swift dependencies
# unwatchable: Dependabot's swift ecosystem reads the REPOSITORY, not the working
# tree, and aborted the whole run daily against a manifest it could not fetch.
# A .resolved file is a lockfile, and lockfiles are tracked.
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
